    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Merry Fairy",
    "steam_appid": 2364180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/ed5b3b5ddd386c80e3a75497fd96ed70.avif?t=1755085924\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to my home, an enchanted cottage named &quot;<i>The Merry Fairy</i>&quot;, because I am, indeed, quite a merry one. I invited you here to rest and relax. But I must warn you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/16f28d5e5f9b18b9eb173fc40aaa04b8.avif?t=1755085924\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My home is filled with abundance and serenity. There is nothing that will stress you, challenge you or push you towards any goal. All is plentiful and readily available. You need not worry about a thing. Just relax and unwind in this enchanted haven of mine. I've asked the weather to accommodate your wishes, my friends to come by if you need any help or company, and a handful of enchanted candles that will light your space for as long as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.poster.avif?t=1755085924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.webm?t=1755085924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.mp4?t=1755085924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also left you a brand new journal that you write your thoughts in and can decorate as you please. I found the art of scrapbook journaling a powerful practice to  master my own magic. Since I sense you might be a magical creature, like me, I think you might find scrapbook journaling as exciting as I did.\u00a0You may explore my desk as if it were your own, and use any decorations you like!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wish you a pleasant stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/ae7a6d724156e6d4a2991485a1ccb366.avif?t=1755085924\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/ed5b3b5ddd386c80e3a75497fd96ed70.avif?t=1755085924\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to my home, an enchanted cottage named &quot;<i>The Merry Fairy</i>&quot;, because I am, indeed, quite a merry one. I invited you here to rest and relax. But I must warn you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/16f28d5e5f9b18b9eb173fc40aaa04b8.avif?t=1755085924\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My home is filled with abundance and serenity. There is nothing that will stress you, challenge you or push you towards any goal. All is plentiful and readily available. You need not worry about a thing. Just relax and unwind in this enchanted haven of mine. I've asked the weather to accommodate your wishes, my friends to come by if you need any help or company, and a handful of enchanted candles that will light your space for as long as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.poster.avif?t=1755085924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.webm?t=1755085924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/b270eb7926996eb6ea660b0741db4d74.mp4?t=1755085924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also left you a brand new journal that you write your thoughts in and can decorate as you please. I found the art of scrapbook journaling a powerful practice to  master my own magic. Since I sense you might be a magical creature, like me, I think you might find scrapbook journaling as exciting as I did.\u00a0You may explore my desk as if it were your own, and use any decorations you like!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wish you a pleasant stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364180/extras/ae7a6d724156e6d4a2991485a1ccb366.avif?t=1755085924\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Merry Fairy is a gentle self discovery tool where you relax and create a scrapbook journal. All decorations are readily available. No challenges, just peace, abundance and creativity. Accept Fairy's invitation to her enchanted desk and spend some time to discover your inner magic.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe Merry Fairy's fairytale inscriptions and charming world design make for an extraordinarily beautiful and well-orchestrated journaling expedition.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 Gaming dot net<br>",
